# SQLCipher release tarball provenance. The generated amalgamation
# (`amalgamation/sqlite3.c` + `sqlite3.h` + `sqlite3ext.h`) is vendored in-tree
# because regenerating it needs GNU tclsh + the SQLCipher `./configure` machinery
# and is not tractable at Android build time. This file records the upstream
# release we amalgamated, for auditability. Regenerating instructions live in
# README.md §3.
#
# Format: <sha256>  <filename>  <url>
